{"resource":"lines/grand-total-athletics","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":6,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"4c69b32bb83088c93380cbfb2b454ad5d638f2a9f3f77a5b359c97c9d32c3c16","cited_as":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt"}],"count":1},"rows":[{"line_key":"grand total athletics","label":"GRAND TOTAL ATHLETICS","fy":2014,"stage":"actual","value":302462.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"grand total athletics","label":"GRAND TOTAL ATHLETICS","fy":2015,"stage":"actual","value":336738.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"grand total athletics","label":"GRAND TOTAL ATHLETICS","fy":2016,"stage":"actual","value":324730.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget/text/fy19-proposed-athletics-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"grand total athletics","label":"GRAND TOTAL ATHLETICS","fy":2017,"stage":"actual","value":379245.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/distr